Third-party parts bundled in the downloadable builds

Qt for Python (PySide6) and Qt: LGPL-3.0. They ship as separate library files
inside the app folder, so they can be swapped for your own builds.
Source: https://code.qt.io/  ·  https://www.qt.io/licensing/open-source-lgpl-obligations
openpyxl: MIT. Python: PSF License. PyInstaller bootloader: GPL-2.0 with an
exception that allows it to be used in programs under any license.
